00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:27.220
So I'll go ahead and I'm
going to hit Enter and install

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:30.380
all these packages from
that validated repository.

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:38.990
All right.

00:13:38.990 --> 00:13:40.390
There we go.

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:41.930
So now the stage is set.

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:44.770
So let's go ahead and
create a Shiny application

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:47.470
to explore this ADaM data set.

