00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:08.710
So before we do that,
let's first save it.

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:10.660
So I hit this
little floppy symbol

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:13.660
and we'll save it as app.R

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:17.830
And you can
see right here, I

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:21.700
